+
+# Shenzhen Friends (docs/friends-integration.md § 3.3 in the Shenzhen Files
+# repository): the GTK views, client library and cJSON come prebuilt in one
+# archive from a pinned shenzhen-pdf checkout, which tools/setup-friends.sh
+# builds. The paths are absolute and outside this tree on purpose: a meson
+# subproject could not reach the views' sibling directories (client/, cJSON).
+friends_root = get_option('friends_root')
+friends_enabled = friends_root != ''
+friends_dep = []
